ntic-job/d8d166906884606b13f9a636db2c1efd2c9718e4c7984b671b0c92df67d5ebe9","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/88958828d9af4ca553462c38b29d8514f35242708d8a0492cca59db11f457ed0","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/9a46a12976a1020d5ab1e12524f47719058ff6b9e5bb78fff621d8f120938321"],"disposition":"pending"},{"pressureRef":"assessment-pressure:03-sandbox-and-environment","text":"According to helperPlan.sandboxRoot, all nine commands and the typed observation ran in the helper sandbox, not only check-inventory. The execution task, not the Design, injected the environment entries. Whether sandbox materialization counts as the admitted worksite state, and whether the injected environment counts as admitted capability behavior, is not classified.","requirementRefs":["requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/db07c18d91f1dcee127290132e58619874224e0edc21af9af0b29245818242ff","requirement://abiogenesis/semantic-job/31fcd6813562347ff58ee3be2eed9320788c8a8ea87ec9d16a71e1fb994dae55"],"disposition":"unassessed"},{"pressureRef":"assessment-pressure:04-carried-rulings","text":"The owner rulings in the candidate's pressure 11 stay open, as do the ABI readiness classifications and the stale stage-2.json. No negative probe exists. This assessment grants no admission, acceptance or ruling, and application coverage remains non-closing.","requirementRefs":[],"disposition":"conflicting"}]}
